%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko... and her father...?\d%K%P
「美都子和…她的父亲？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...Why did you think that?\d%K%P
「…为什么会那么觉得呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean, this is the Terrace House Hinosaka here, right?\d%K%P
「因为这是…Terrace House阳之坂吧？」%K%P
I glanced at the scenery behind the two in the picture.%K%P
把注意力从婴儿和她的父亲身上移开，\n观看周围的风景…%K%P
Shabby gates with a long run-down one-floor building\nbehind them.%K%P
古旧的门槛。\n还有简陋而…别有风情的平房。%K%P
The place that meant so much to me. It was right there, in\nthat photograph.%K%P
对如今的我来说，无比重要的地方，就在其中。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYeah, you have a keen eye. It's Toko.\d%K%P
「嗯，你的眼力还不错。\n那个确实是小都子」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHmm... She was pretty cute, haha.\d%K%P
「嘿…挺可爱的啊，哈哈」%K%P
That said, I would probably never have the chance to tell\nthat to her face.%K%P
我虽然夸了她，但肯定没有让她本人得知的机会吧。%K%P
After all, finding out that I saw this picture would\nlikely cause Mitoko to break down in tears out of sheer\nembarrassment.%K%P
不管怎样，在我看这张相片的时候，觉得她很可爱，\n但对于美都子来说，那可真是一件出糗的事儿。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut why do you have this picture? Did she give it to\nyou?\d%K%P
「可是，你为什么会保留着这张相片呢？\n美都子交给你的吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dWell, who do you think is the man holding Mitoko in his\narms?\d%K%P
「嘛，是抱着小都子的男人。\n…你觉得那是谁？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, isn't it Mitoko's father...?\d%K%P
「不，就是说，美都子的父亲…」%K%P
Puzzled by Himeo's words, I once again considered the\nstout gentleman in the picture. He definitely was not how\nI imagined Ms. Honoka's husband would have looked.%K%P
对姬绪小姐的反问感到困惑的我，\n对穗香小姐的丈夫，慎重而有礼地凝视了起来。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI guess that's the natural thing to assume.\d%K%P
「果然会那么想啊」%K%P
Actually, I felt like I'd seen him somewhere before.%K%P
可是，总觉得似曾相识。%K%P
I could've sworn I'd seen him as an older man in the\nrecent issue of...%K%P
而且比这张相片更久远的，\n还有最近的…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dTo tell the truth, I found this picture in my father's\nstudy.\d%K%P
「实话说，这张相片，是我在父亲的书房看到的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, so it's your father, then... ...?!\d%K%P
「哎，你父亲的………啊！？」%K%P
Himeo said it so casually I nearly missed the point.%K%P
姫绪小姐若无其事的叙述，\n差点让我忽略掉重要的问题。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dSawashima Junpei -- the very man who built up the\nSawashima Group from nothing. And also my father.\d%K%P
「泽嶋顺平。\n泽嶋集团的创始人…也就是『我的』父亲」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Wait a second... This is Mitoko... And this is your\nfather... so...\d%K%P
「诶，慢着慢着…\n这是美都子的…\n那也是姬绪小姐的父亲…也就是说…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThe reason I left Nagoya and instead went for a\nuniversity here was because I wanted to meet someone, no\nmatter what -- my little sister.\d%K%P
「我离开名古屋，到这里求学来…\n是因为有个无论如何也要见的人…我的『妹妹』」%K%P
